{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power","id":1522859,"title":"What would be a good saving throw for this Amalgam power","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-09-20T15:58:24-07:00","id":1522859,"title":"What would be a good saving throw for this Amalgam power","content":"Okay I've been working on a rough draft of an amalgam power based on Soul Mask that uses Fortitude &amp; Obfuscate level three powers in this case.<br /> <br /> I'm using Mask of a Thousand Faces &amp; Fortify The Inner Facade with Stamina + Obfuscate as the dice pool. But of course like any power it can be overcome and I'm stuck on should I use Resolve + Auspex as one way to beat it as I can see being very focused in your actions to shred the illusion, but I can also see using Intelligence + Auspex to beat it by knowing what look for. Both I can see working as a effective counter to this power. What do you think I should use in regards in power?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T23:43:28-07:00","id":1522880,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power#post1522859\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay I've been working on a rough draft of an amalgam power based on Soul Mask that uses Fortitude &amp; Obfuscate level three powers in this case.<br /> <br /> I'm using Mask of a Thousand Faces &amp; Fortify The Inner Facade with Stamina + Obfuscate as the dice pool. But of course like any power it can be overcome and I'm stuck on should I use Resolve + Auspex as one way to beat it as I can see being very focused in your actions to shred the illusion, but I can also see using Intelligence + Auspex to beat it by knowing what look for. Both I can see working as a effective counter to this power. What do you think I should use in regards in power?</div> </div> </div> </div>Either could work imho. Wits too, if you go with the idea of an agile mind that catches on that things are not adding up right and something is screwing up one's mind/senses.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, could not some skill (like Awareness, since a supernatural power is involved) also go into this counter-roll instead of Auspex, or alongside it if one uses [attribute]+[skill]+[discipline] rolls in their games like in Requiem, for example?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T09:42:05-07:00","id":1522904,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1522880#post1522880\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Either could work imho. Wits too, if you go with the idea of an agile mind that catches on that things are not adding up right and something is screwing up one's mind/senses.<br /> <br /> Incidentally, could not some skill (like Awareness, since a supernatural power is involved) also go into this counter-roll instead of Auspex, or alongside it if one uses [attribute]+[skill]+[discipline] rolls in their games like in Requiem, for example?</div> </div> </div> </div>That is something that I didn't think of using in regards to using wits as a counter roll, but I think using Auspex should be kept as you are using supernatural means to counter another supernatural power.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T12:11:33-07:00","id":1522915,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1522904#post1522904\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That is something that I didn't think of using in regards to using wits as a counter roll, but I think using Auspex should be kept as you are using supernatural means to counter another supernatural power.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see definitely see why, - and yet:<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>V20, pgs.100-101</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Awareness</b> - Awareness is an <i>instinctual</i> reaction to <i>the presence of the supernatural</i>. It differs from Alertness (which measures sensitivity to mundane events) and Occult (which covers actual knowledge about the supernatural). Usually, only supernatural creatures have access to this particular Talent, but some unique mortals have a sense that something is strange in the world (such as those with True Faith \u2013 see p. 372).<br /> Characters with Awareness sometimes <i>get hunches, chills, or sudden flashes of inspiration when they are near supernatural creatures, objects, or events</i>. This insight is purely subconscious, and knowing that something\u2019s wrong doesn\u2019t mean that the character knows what it is. To get more specific information, the Kindred will need to use Occult or a particular power \u2013 Awareness only makes the vampire more receptive to the presence of the unusual.<br /> A vampire can use Awareness deliberately if he suspects that something is supernatural, but more often the Storyteller can ask for an Awareness roll to determine whether a vampire notices a strange event that\u2019s not immediately visible.\u200b</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200b<br /> <br /> The skill most certainly fits on this particular situation - and more individuals will possess or develop a talent through happenstance and need than train themselves into a discipline. For something of an outside perspective, it's like in a Fera-focused if the parts started debating matters of Heightened Senses, Scent of True Form, Sight From Beyond or Pulse of the Invisible before getting one's first dot in Primal-Urge, so to speak. I think you might be going with a &quot;top-down priorization&quot; due to issues between editions.<br /> <br /> Just my two cents of thought here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-22T09:51:10-07:00","id":1522963,"title":"","content":"Still you gave me many ideas on how to fine tune this version of SoulMask, though I think Emotional Mask might be a good title for what I envision so far.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-23T14:17:32-07:00","id":1523046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1522963#post1522963\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Still you gave me many ideas on how to fine tune this version of SoulMask, though I think Emotional Mask might be a good title for what I envision so far.</div> </div> </div> </div>Veiling the Heart, so to speak?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T11:09:59-07:00","id":1523085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a 