al Mask power later this week.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good luck with what you're cooking up - as an aside, any relation to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523041-is-it-plausible-that-an-older-ancilla-could-have-5-dots-in-one-discipline\">that older ancilla</a> topic or the questions about Mithras? Just curious.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T16:58:13-07:00","id":1523106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1523100#post1523100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Good luck with what you're cooking up - as an aside, any relation to <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1523041-is-it-plausible-that-an-older-ancilla-could-have-5-dots-in-one-discipline\">that older ancilla</a> topic or the questions about Mithras? Just curious.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks and in regards to the Mithras post and Ancilla posts I think my questions were answered well enough. But I did like the idea of the current Mithras being another in a line of Ventrue ancients using the name and it certainly changes the lore.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-24T18:50:51-07:00","id":1523112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1523106#post1523106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thanks and in regards to the Mithras post and Ancilla posts I think my questions were answered well enough.</div> </div> </div> </div>Good to know and asked the question also because i remembered you once asking about possible motives for Mithras as a prince to spare the unlife of a malkavian (at the time) recently embraced without permit and it kind of crossed my mind if all those topics might or not tie up somehow to each other, what made me curious.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lysander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1523106#post1523106\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But I did like the idea of the current Mithras being another in a line of Ventrue ancients using the name and it certainly changes the lore.</div> </div> </div> </div>That turned out into a very interesting idea indeed, but the funny part is, i kind of meant the opposite - the ancient Ventrue is the same, but Mithras is not the first, nor won't be the last deity he impersonates across the ages, and that he might have existed for a time in Rome itself, under the name of a roman or etruscan god for example, only to later adopt the Mithras persona during his move to the British Isles, for example.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 09-24-2023, 10:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-25T09:36:05-07:00","id":1523138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1522859-what-would-be-a-good-saving-throw-for-this-amalgam-power?p=1523112#post1523112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Good to know and asked the question also because i remembered you once asking about possible motives for Mithras as a prince to spare the unlife of a malkavian (at the time) recently embraced without permit and it kind of crossed my mind if all those topics might or not tie up somehow to each other, what made me curious.<br /> <br /> <br /> I decided that it wasn't Mithras that spared my Malkavian's &quot;life&quot;, but It it would be Valerius or the future Queen Anne as I like the idea of Mithras being involved in schemes to spread the power of the British Empire. <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> That turned out into a very interesting idea indeed, but the funny part is, i kind of meant the opposite - the ancient Ventrue is the same, but Mithras is not the first, nor won't be the last deity he impersonates across the ages, and that he might have existed for a time in Rome itself, under the name of a roman or etruscan god for example, only to later adopt the Mithras persona during his move to the British Isles, for example.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> It's certainly an interesting take that the Ventrue Mithras has used the names of various war gods over the ages before he settled on his current name.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-28T13:47:57-07:00","id":1523288,"title":"","content":"Okay here is my first draft of my new Amalgam power. Emotional Mask<br /> Fortitude 3 Obfuscate 3<br /> Cost: One Rouse Check<br /> Dice Pool: Stamina + Obfuscate vs Awareness + Auspex<br /> Prequistes: Fortify Inner Facade &amp; Mask of a Thousand Faces <br /> A useful and subtle power used by many Ancilla &amp; Elders who desire to mask there emotional aura colors and present whatever emotional state they wish to present.<br /> <br /> System: Roll a Stamina + Obfuscate dice vs Wits &amp; Auspex at difficulty 4 as the Kindred chooses the projection of a single aura color &amp; shade that they are familiar with or it's an automatic failure.<br /> <br /> Duration: 1 Scene. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}